// Development set for pipeline_probe. Tune the prompt and the bank against THIS file.
// Labels follow prompts/nlu_system.md. Slots list only what must be right; a leading "the" is ignored.
// Unsupported languages are scored on intent only: the executor answers "English and Tagalog only" for any other value.
// Conventions: "where is X" -> place.locate; "how far is X" -> unknown; alerting/contacting the guardian -> emergency.trigger;
// calling anyone else -> unknown; "stop" -> navigation.stop; "mute" -> system.volume down.

